SetMode_Pair_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── when vault zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when tokenIn zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when tokenOut zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when tokenIn equals tokenOut
   │  └── it should revert with SameToken
   └── when all addresses valid and distinct
      ├── given mode ORACLE_CHECKED
      │  ├── it should set modeOf to ORACLE_CHECKED
      │  ├── it should make isAllowed return true
      │  └── it should emit PairModeSet
      ├── given mode OPERATOR_TRUSTED
      │  ├── it should set modeOf to OPERATOR_TRUSTED
      │  ├── it should make isAllowed return true
      │  └── it should emit PairModeSet
      └── given mode DISALLOWED
         ├── it should clear the entry
         ├── it should make isAllowed return false
         └── it should emit PairModeSet
